      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER SEALANT (7) rocketed out of the inside draw with a strong early sectional and gave a sight but had to settle for a placing, finishing second (22.59) at this track over 390m. Top chance in this line up. PAW XELA (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.76) at Warrnambool behind Live Forever in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Hard to beat again. KING PLUM (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at Healesville over 300m behind Thai Butterfly (17.63) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and six minor placings to his credit. Cannot be taken lightly. ",
